SUMMARY:Open House Chicago:唐人街 Pui Tak Center 免费参观
LOCATION:Pui Tak Center\, 2216 S Wentworth Ave\, Chicago\, IL 60616
DESCRIPTION:🏯 免费进唐人街百年中式老楼!\n1928年建成的 Pu
 i Tak Center(原安良工商会大楼)\,可登三楼阳台俯瞰唐人街
 👀\n还能摸一摸原始琉璃陶砖\,带娃寻根超有意义~\n费用
 :免费\nhttps://openhousechicago.org/sites/reccKiqVCYutXnjfG
URL:https://openhousechicago.org/sites/reccKiqVCYutXnjfG
END:VEVENT
